@startuml
!define PRIMARY_COLOR #2E86AB
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor PRIMARY_COLOR
}
title Diagramme de déploiement

node "Client Browser" as Browser
node "Frontend Container\nReact App\nPort 3000" as Frontend
node "Backend Container\nLaravel API\nPort 8000" as Backend
node "DB Container\nMySQL\nPort 3306\nVolume: /var/lib/mysql" as Database
cloud "Google Maps" as GMAPS

Browser --> Frontend : HTTPS
Frontend --> Backend : HTTPS
Backend --> Database : TCP
Backend --> GMAPS : HTTPS

note bottom
Environnements:
dev (SQLite option), staging, prod (MySQL).
Conteneurisation via Docker; reverse proxy possible (Nginx).
end note
@enduml
